{"id":120348966659817,"name":"(SUMMER!☀️) Green Bay, Wisconsin🌾","desc":"Welcome to Green Bay, Wisconsin!🌾\n\n🚗 Drive through the streets of Green Bay, Wisconsin! 🌆 \nWith many vehicles to choose from, you can explore the city in style for free!\n\n🚗Join the group for a FREE car!\n\ninspired by Dorset County\nhttps://www.roblox.com/games/9192052824/Dorset-County \n\n👮if you switch to the police team, reset to get your taser.\n\n⚠️if you find any bugs, please report them so they can be fixed!⚠️\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/11860552/Crash-Hard#!/about \n\ncredit to TroIlfaceGaming_Real for the chassis\nhttps://www.roblox.com/users/911235414/profile ","path":"/game/120348966659817-green-bay-wisconsin","slug":"120348966659817-green-bay-wisconsin","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b0856afdea4cc682f3eadcee10c4a4b96c50200bea4ac842deb2e210abebef2e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9bc336c68472f57d142c02af0f388be8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":1533355,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-10T22:39:28.682Z","creator":{"name":"Too Blue Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"68c1fe209dfcc70fa4d4d58f","title":"Spawn Paid Cars (WORKING)","game":{"_id":"68c1fe209dfcc70fa4d4d58c","gameId":120348966659817,"name":"(SUMMER!☀️) Green Bay, Wisconsin🌾","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"120348966659817-green-bay-wisconsin","path":"/game/120348966659817-green-bay-wisconsin","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":120348966659817},"slug":"(SUMMER!)-Green-Bay-Wisconsin-Spawn-Paid-Cars-52531","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":5286,"executes":301,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ba0b663dce8a708544283273bef14d6885df3d2e680ec9a2b387a650bbe40ad.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/120348966659817-1757543968660.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/120348966659817-1757543968660.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ba0b663dce8a708544283273bef14d6885df3d2e680ec9a2b387a650bbe40ad.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/120348966659817-1757543968660.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/120348966659817-1757543968660.png"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-09-10T22:39:28.683Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-10T22:39:28.683Z","lastBump":"2025-09-10T22:39:28.683Z","script":"local player = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer\nlocal playerGui = player:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\nlocal carsGui = playerGui:WaitForChild(\"Cars\")\n\nlocal sourceFrame = carsGui:WaitForChild(\"Frame\")\nlocal destinationFrame = carsGui:WaitForChild(\"Frame2\")\n\nfor _, item in ipairs(destinationFrame:GetChildren()) do\n    local existingCallScript = item:FindFirstChild(\"CallScript\")\n    \n    if existingCallScript then\n        existingCallScript:Destroy()\n    end\nend\n\nlocal originalCallScript = sourceFrame:WaitForChild(\"08Charger\"):WaitForChild(\"CallScript\")\n\nif originalCallScript then\n    for _, item in ipairs(destinationFrame:GetChildren()) do\n        if item:IsA(\"GuiObject\") then\n            local newCallScript = originalCallScript:Clone()\n            \n            newCallScript.Parent = item\n        end\n    end\nend\n\n--By Semyon","features":"Free Paid cars yaaaaaaaaay\n\nhow to:\njoin the game, execute the script, open the cars menu, and spawn whatever you want","tags":[],"discord":"https://discord.gg/amB9GCbYDj","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"65f05c0f67f2033080cb423d","username":"Semyon","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/64f1b3fc65386d1cf7e69bee45e07a492c47c0f499ac7d51bc7da9f3c60b0f76.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65f05c0f67f2033080cb423d-17820